        "original_id": "b7cf67b5-ac56-534b-b2d8-12d0469aca92",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jukka Backlund\n- Bands: Franz Ferdinand, Sunrise Avenue\n- Albums: You Could Have It So Much Better, On the Way to Wonderland\n- Places: Glasgow, Helsinki, Finland\n- Topics: rock music, album production\n\nFacts:\n- Franz Ferdinand are a Scottish rock band formed in 2002 and based in Glasgow.\n- Sunrise Avenue is a Finnish rock band originally formed in 2002 in Helsinki, Finland.\n- You Could Have It So Much Better is the second studio album by Franz Ferdinand.\n- Jukka Backlund is best known for producing Sunrise Avenue's first album, On the Way to Wonderland.\n- On the Way to Wonderland is described as the best-selling international debut from Finland.",
